        "subject": "LU-10026 csdc: fix lz4/lz4fast compression level handling",
        "message": "LU-10026 csdc: fix lz4/lz4fast compression level handling\n\nFor lz4, a compression level < LZ4HC_MIN_CLEVEL == 3 must be\ninterpreted as a standard, i.e. non HC compression level of\nLZ4_ACCELERATION_DEFAULT, to mock behavior of lz4 userspace utility.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nSigned-off-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I2d2492870187b264b26af0abf474177b504fa41a\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
